    ["p002","other-person-fact",{"statement":{"en":"Through the whole Jin age only Zhao Zhiwei's calendar was used; the Yuan compilers' dynasty used it at first, then replaced it with the Season-Granting Calendar.","zh":"是以終金之世，惟用知微曆，我朝初亦用之，後始改《授時曆》焉。"}},"explicit",["s0016"]],
