  "translationRepairs": [
    ["s0011","idiomatic","Prognostication and observation drifted apart; the Directorate ordered Zhao Zhiwei to revise the Grand Clarity Calendar, and in eleven years the revision was done.","Prognostication and observation drifted apart; Zhao Zhiwei, Director of the Astronomical Directorate, was therefore ordered to revise the Grand Clarity Calendar, and in the eleventh year the calendar was completed.","s0011 命司天監趙知微 takes Zhao Zhiwei with title 司天監 as the object of 命, not the Directorate as agent; 十一年曆成 is the eleventh year, not a span of eleven years; the proposed wording is accurate.","high","applied"],
    ["s0011","literal","From this prognostication and observation drifted; therefore the Directorate ordered Zhao Zhiwei to revise the Grand Clarity Calendar—it was completed in the eleventh year.","From this prognostication and observation drifted; therefore Zhao Zhiwei, Director of the Astronomical Directorate, was ordered to revise the Grand Clarity Calendar—it was completed in the eleventh year.","s0011 命司天監趙知微 names Zhao Zhiwei under the title 司天監 as the person ordered; the Directorate is not the ordering agent, so the literal correction is required and accurate.","high","applied"],
    ["s0014","idiomatic","Early in Mingchang the calendar office proposed yet another revision; Zhang Xingjian of the Rites Bureau said, \"Wait for another solar eclipse, re-check until there is no discrepancy, and only then adopt it.\"","Early in Mingchang the calendar office proposed yet another revision; Zhang Xingjian, Director of the Ministry of Rites, said, \"Please wait for another solar or lunar eclipse, re-check until there is no discrepancy, and only then adopt it.\"","s0014 has 禮部郎中張行簡 and 請俟他日月食; 日月食 covers solar or lunar eclipse, and 禮部郎中 is his office title, so the proposed idiomatic repair is accurate.","high","applied"],
    ["s0014","literal","Early Mingchang, the Directorate again reformed a new calendar; Zhang Xingjian, Director of Rites, said: \"Please wait for another solar eclipse, re-verify without discrepancy, then use it.\"","Early Mingchang, the Directorate again reformed a new calendar; Zhang Xingjian, Director of Rites, said: \"Please wait for another solar or lunar eclipse, re-verify without discrepancy, then use it.\"","s0014 請俟他日月食 means wait for another solar or lunar eclipse; rendering only a solar eclipse omits the lunar alternative, and the proposed literal fix is accurate.","high","applied"],
    ["s0250","idiomatic","Cover and subtract the day factor; the remainder is sunset fen.","Cover and subtract from the day factor; the remainder is sunset fen.","After s0249 yields sunrise fen, s0250 覆減日法 means subtract that result from the day factor; adding “from” correctly identifies the minuend and matches the remainder as sunset fen.","high","applied"],
    ["s0252","literal","Subtract sunrise fen by dusk-and-dawn fen for dawn fen; add to sunset fen for dusk fen.","Subtract dusk-and-dawn fen from sunrise fen for dawn fen; add to sunset fen for dusk fen.","s0252 以昏明分減日出分 is subtract dusk-and-dawn fen from sunrise fen; “subtract sunrise fen by …” reverses the relation and is ungrammatical, so the proposed literal is required.","high","applied"]
  ],
